[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the\nramp.</p><p>Proceed with the removal <a href=\"#/3025364\">4450B11</a> .</p><p>Proceed with the removal <a href=\"#/3025334\">4420A10</a> .</p><p>1. Fit spring/shock aborber assembly (1a) to tool (1b) and compress.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Mount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.874.555.001</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004594.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Undo the nut (1a) for the shock absorber upper buffer using the\ntool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.973.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Loosen the tool and separate upper buffer (2a), gaiter (2c),\nlower washer (2d) and damper (2e).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004595.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Assemble the spring/shock absorber\ncomponents and fit to the tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Mount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.874.555.001</p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Tighten the nut (1a) for the shock absorber upper buffer to the\nrecommended torque using the tool (1b).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Assuming the torque wrench setting\nshown in the table to be the nominal value, use the tool shown to\ncalculate a new torque taking the lever into account.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>UPPER REAR DAMPER ATTACHMENT 9S.M.)</p></td><td><p>M14</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>6.3 ÷ 7.7</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.973.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004596.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>Loosen the tool and remove\nthe spring/shock absorber assembly.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting <a href=\"#/3025334\">4420A10</a> .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting <a href=\"#/3025364\">4450B11</a> .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting <a href=\"#/3025357\">4450A40</a> .</p>"]]